window.products.push({"id":194118,"name":"10.5\" Adorable Golden Retriever ON Beach Clock - Large 10.5\" Wall Clock - Home Décor Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":33.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1znAfhIZ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is not a wood clock. This is an image custom printed onto an OPEN FACE CLOCK with no cover over the top. This clock does not need a frame. It is a rigid thick hard base clock face with a quartz clock movement mounted on the back. There is a built-in hanger on the back of the clock movement for easy hanging. Each clock in the shop is handmade to order. This is not a store bought plastic clock and the face is almost twice the size of competitors. All parts including the quartz clock movement are made in the USA. CLOCK DETAILS: Large 10.5\" Open face means no cover or frame. Thick hard base. Quartz clock movement made in USA, Guaranteed 2 yrs, AA battery not included. Large 4.5\" metal (not plastic) hands. Recommended for indoor use not outdoor. The printed face can be personalized free if you choose. You will just need to send me a message through the message system. The high resolution image is printed using a large format professional laser jet printer producing sharp pictures with vivid colors. This is NOT meant to be an outdoor clock. Each clock is made to order. Printing and assembling will take 2 business days to process. You should receive your clock within 7 business days after payment.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1znAfhIZ+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"EasySells","source_asin":"B075H8ZM4C","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194118","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B075H8ZM4C","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B075H8ZM4C","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
