window.products.push({"id":194120,"name":"ELEOVO Round Fitted Vinyl Tablecloth Elastic Table Cover with Elastic Edge and Flannel Backing,Waterproof Plastic Table Cover for Outdoor, Patio, Kitc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ur874db2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"【Beautiful & Multi-Colors】With bright colors, flannel backing, there are several colors with this vinyl tablecloth, such as Wicker/Moroccan/Lattice /Wood/Marble patterns for you to choose.Enhance any table setting with these Modern boho style/ Classic gingham style designs that will add a nice touch to your table, and overall dining experience. In the garden or out traveling on a trip, you will come to enjoy these fun, practical and attractive covers! 【Easy to Clean】 Because this PVC vinyl tablecloth is water and oil-proof, the liquids like coffee、milk will bead upon its surface, you just need a damp cloth or sponge to wipe clean. The vinyl plastic tablecloth is also much easier to wipe clean than fabric tablecloths. Do not machine wash, wipe with a cloth or wash by hand. The wrinkles and creases can be removed facilely by using low-heat dryer settings. 【High Quality & Reusable Use】Our tablecloth is made with premium 420 GSM PVC vinyl plastic with thicker flannel backing, which is durable that can help keep dust off and prevents dents, chips, and scratches from forming. The plastic vinyl tablecloth can be used over and over again. It is good for you to use if you always have a party, holiday celebration, BBQ in your home. 【Measure Your Table Size】Our vinyl table cloth with an elasticized edge is suitable for round tables with a diameter in the range of 43-56 inches (or 109-142 cm), fitted for 6 or 7 seats round tables. A bigger table will require a bigger tablecloth, and you can avoid the trouble of return & exchange by spending a few seconds measuring your table's size first. 【Serves Multi-Purposes】 The vinyl table cover has an elastic edge, it will keep the vinyl tablecloth tightly fitted to your round table and stay free from moving/falling off. The Vinyl tablecloth is waterproof and easy to clean great for general all-purpose activities like dining, painting, board gaming, and working with modeling clay. It is perfect for kids and family dinner, and keeps dirt and dust out of your outdoor patio tables.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81ur874db2L._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ELEOVO","source_asin":"B08F2HF1QY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194120","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08F2HF1QY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08F2HF1QY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
