window.products.push({"id":194196,"name":"CACOLULU Black Balloons Garland Arch - 120Pcs 18+12+10+5 Inch Black Latex Balloons Arch Kit, Black Balloons Different Sizes Pack for Graduation Decora","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dwoptb2CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"120Pcs Black Balloon Arch Kit - Contains 4pcs black party balloons of 18 inches, 20pcs 12 inch black balloons, 46pcs 10 inch balloons black and 50pcs black 5 inch balloons, and a small ribbon help to decorate. A total of 120 pieces. Well-matched quantities to plump up your balloon arch, black balloon garland that extended to serve as a backdrop, creating a gorgeous party environment worthy of being the background of the pictures. Superior Latex Balloons - Made of natural latex, black balloons different sizes are stretchy and non-toxic, harmless, and able to play around children. Exquisite balloon craftsmanship is both conducive to making vibrant color balloons and guarantees the quality of the bright black balloon. Thickened balloons black is long-lasting instead of popping in halfway. Easy to Apply - Provided with high elasticity, black balloons different sizes pack is easily inflated by air or helium in the correct size. At first, fill the balloons arch with 12inch and 10inch black balloons, add a few 5inch balloons to fill gaps, and finally put 18inch balloons to make a lovely black balloons garland! Hold about at least three days when ballons black filled with air and 3-6 hours when filled with helium in black balloons garland kit. Multiple Applications - Nothing livens a party or event like stunning balloons. Numerous theme parties lie on limitless combinations of colorful balloons. Black and gold balloons as new year's party decorations, red and black balloons as graduation balloons, black and white balloons, black and silver balloons for birthday or wedding balloons. Black and yellow honeybee baby shower. Also, spice up Halloween decorations with orange and black. More themed parties are waiting for you! Warm Tips - A bit of dust on the black latex balloons is a safe material to keep from sticking. Recommend using a balloon pump to inflate. Please notice that do not overinflate the graduation black balloons 12inch to maintain a perfect shape as long as possible, and pay attention to avoid sun exposure, sharp objects, and excessive friction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Dwoptb2CL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CACOLULU","source_asin":"B0B3T5LG57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194196","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B3T5LG57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B3T5LG57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
