window.products.push({"id":194266,"name":"16 Pieces Galaxy Party Bags Space Party Favor Bags Starry Night Party Gift Goodie Bags Galaxy Treat Candy Bags Space Stars Theme Party Supplies for Ga","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F-yR-95fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Sufficient Quantity: package contains 16 pieces of galaxy party favor bags, each features a fantastic galaxy design with shinning stars, enough quantity can meet your daily uses and festival uses; If you are about to hold a galaxy theme birthday party, you can put some souvenirs in the bag to give your guests, whatever adults and children will love it Charming Design: these outer space goodie bags are designed with rich typical galaxy themed elements with the decor of galaxy shining star and blue background, full of starry night theme, creating a nice visual experience and party atmosphere; It is so attractive that your families and guests will like it Reusable and Sturdy: space theme paper bags are made of quality paper, which is sturdy, serviceable and reusable to serve you for long term use if stored well; Our goodie bags are also lightweight, convenient and portable for you to carry party favors or gifts, adding more festive atmosphere for your children in the birthday party Suitable Size: each starry night party goody bag adopt a handle design and measures approx. 22 x 16 x 8 cm/ 8.7 x 6.3 x 3.1 inches, which is large enough for you to hold various toys or small items, such as gifts, biscuits, candies, cookies, chocolate, lollipops and various crafts Wide Applications: these galaxy birthday party treat bags are suitable for birthdays, galaxy theme parties, outer space themed parties, star themed parties, etc., and they can also be applied for Christmas, baby showers, weddings or daily uses; Wherever they are placed, they will surely be fantastic party decorations","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81F-yR-95fL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Marspark","source_asin":"B09N133STV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194266","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09N133STV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09N133STV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":194267,"name":"artgeist Canvas Wall Art Print Quotes Family 59x20 in - 1pcs Home Decor Framed Stretched Picture Photo Painting Artwork Image - Family House Faux Wood","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1BCJ7IM42L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"CANVAS PICTURES Printed pictures are trending lately when it comes to interior designing – they serve as an alternative to classic paintings.High quality materials and large-format printers give us the opportunity to recreate even the tiniest details of the copied photography. Pictures are also UV-resistant and this is why colors are sharper than ever. Every picture is stretched over a wooden frame – you don’t need to worry about any additional utilities in order to put it on the wall. To make sure that the painting will look great on your wall, we mount the canvas onto a matched stretcher bar made of natural, solid wood (1,5 cm thick).We offer a whole variety of different themed pictures, that will give you the possibility to make your surroundings lovelier and hopefully unlock your inner creativity. The highest possible quality and modern approach will surely meet your expectations as a client.Also, keep in mind - we do not offer stocked items - every order is being produced individually after the purchase. Products are made exclusively in our own manufacturing facilities – hence, we offer the best quality vs. price ratio. IMPORTANT In case the picture consists of more than one piece, please remember to keep a certain distance between them (compare it with the picture displayed online).Please keep in mind that because of the screen settings, actual colours may vary from the ones visible on the picture online. Pictures are only displayed for illustration purposes. They serve as an exemplar of how the canvas print might look like in a particular surrounding. Please measure your wall properly and make sure you pick the right size.It's possible only to send 3 products in one package, so if you want to order more products, please submit an appropriate number of individual orders.All our products belong to the Artgeist.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1BCJ7IM42L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"artgeist","source_asin":"B083P54KMJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194267","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B083P54KMJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B083P54KMJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
