window.products.push({"id":194269,"name":"WPM WORLD PRODUCTS MART Black Window Sheer Treatment Panels Beautiful Rod Pocket Voile Elegance Curtains Drapes for Living Room, Bedroom, Kitchen Full","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":14.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F94de+MKL._AC_SL1179_.jpg","description":"MODERN CHOICE: Comes as a set of 2 panels per package, these sheer curtains decorate your windows to bring brightness, love and luxury. Comes in vivid colors to mix and match your décor for living room, bedroom, guest room, kids room, nursery, farmhouse. Mix and match various bright colors as a backdrop decoration to your birthday party wedding party and any other party MATERIAL: These panels are made of quality voile soft texture sheer fabric. Window panels are breathable, allows air and light filtering while providing privacy. Making your space bright and lively. Panels comes with dual rod pockets design on the top, hem and stitched sides and a large hem at the bottom to hold panels well when hanging on a window rod SIZE: Comes as a set of 2 panels in a package, each panel measures 58” inch wide. Choose from 84” inch long or 63” inch long making a total width of 116 inch wide by 84 inch or 63” inch high window. Rod Pocket can fit up to 1.5” inch window rod EASY CARE: Machine wash cold, gentle cycle. Mild detergent no bleach use. Iron on low. Good Quality panels will stand will last years of use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51F94de+MKL._AC_SL1179_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"WPM WORLD PRODUCTS MART","source_asin":"B07P6FJHVJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07P6FJHVJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07P6FJHVJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":194270,"name":"Reusable Metal Straw Set with Bamboo Case & Cotton Carry Bag- Rainbow, Retractable, & Collapsible Telescopic Stainless Steel Straws- Portable, Stylish","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LfTzdxtkL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","description":"FILLED WITH ALOHAMake every sip count when you use the Shaka Love iridescent reusable metal drinking straws! Inspired by the spirit of Aloha, we designed this set of telescopic rainbow drinking straws to remind us to always treat the world around us with goodness, kindness, unity, and love. Each set includes 4 stainless steel telescoping straws, 2 collapsible cleaning brushes, 2 bamboo travel cases, and 1 cotton carry pouch.PERFECTLY PORTABLEWe understand that there’s just something satisfying about sipping your favorite drink through a straw, so we made our reusable straws collapsible and portable. They measure 9.25” fully extended and collapse to the compact size of 4” to fit nicely inside the 4.75” bamboo cases. Slip them into your pocket or keep them in your backpack, beach or gym bag, carry on, or car glove box.QUALITY MATERIALSOur reusable straws are made from top food grade 18/8 stainless steel that’s BPA and lead free. They’re suitable to use for hot and cold beverages so you can use them year round! The durable carrying cases are crafted from sustainable bamboo while the drawstring carry pouch is made from soft, organic cotton.QUICK, EASY CLEANINGPlace the straws in the dishwasher for quick and easy cleaning after use. To wash by hand, use warm soapy water and the included telescoping cleaning brushes to clean the interior of the straws. Fully expand the straws to ensure they’re cleaned thoroughly.LIVE ECO-FANTASTICMade under 100% ethical business practices, Shaka Love reusable stainless steel straws can be used for years to come to effectively reduce the number of single-use plastic straws that often end up in our oceans and take up to 1,000 years to decompose. We are proud members of the global environmental movement “1% for the Planet” and 10% of all profits go to help protect the future of our planet. Thank you for joining us to “Say NO to plastic, Live Eco-Fantastic!”","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LfTzdxtkL._AC_SL1024_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shaka Love","source_asin":"B07ZBQYYB9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194270","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07ZBQYYB9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07ZBQYYB9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
