window.products.push({"id":194319,"name":"Super Soft Flannel Fleece Blanket, Cozy Warm Plush Microfiber Couch/Bed Blanket, 90\"x90\", Navy Blue","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1SHOgEvAEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super Soft, Warm and Cozy Made of 300GSM 100% microfiber polyester, the high density of blanket’s fabric, this fine plush flannel fleece blanket makes it more effective at keeping you warm and perfect for people with sensitive skin or allergies. Get warm and cozy with this super soft and cozy blanket, perfect for snuggling or relaxing on the couch/sofa or use it as part of your bedding to add texture to your home decor. Perfect for all season use. It is also a great gift idea for your friends or family. Even your pets love it! High Quality and Durability 300GSM 100% microfiber polyester, superfine fiber material, provides a soft silky feel, helps to control temperature, and is also completely resistant to shrinking and wrinkling. It is stronger and more durable than regular blankets, and can keep its shape and softness over time. Perfect Choice If you are considering a super soft, cozy and warm blanket, we keep improving the texture to ensure superior quality and offer a reasonable affordable price at the same time. Machine Washable This flannel fleece blanket can go right into the washing machine on gentle cycle for quick, convenient cleaning as needed. Do not bleach. Just machine wash on cold water. To ensure softness enduring, it should be washed alone or with other flannel fleece blankets or similar texture clothing to prevent abrasion.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/A1SHOgEvAEL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Melody House","source_asin":"B074W12WGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194319","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074W12WGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074W12WGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
