window.products.push({"id":194400,"name":"Mecete Wok pan 5th Generation, Traditional Hand Hammered Uncoated Carbon Steel Pow Wok with one piece Steel Handle one piece pan (13.3 Inch, Round Bot","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I1ApTLp1L._AC_SL1296_.jpg","description":"A gift from Chinese Ancient Cook skill: Mecete Chinese hand hammered wok is made of high-quality carbon steel. If clean carbon steel is heated to above 550 degrees F, the surface steel will oxidize to black iron oxide, Fe3O4, showing a beautiful black-blue to aqua-blue patina. This blued or black iron oxide surface, adheres quickly to oils. And the oiled blued steel is very rust resistant, it is also a non-stick surface for cooking. Uncoated and No bubbles: Comparing with the machine-making pot, it is firm and uniform in density without any hollow and air bubbles. It adopts premium quality iron to make, which has few impurities and a smooth surface without coating. Say goodbye to those coated pan and give you a relaxing and healthy cooking experience. Iron dissolved in Cooking: It has great thermal conductivity for transferring the temperature of the fire to the food directly to ensure your nutritious and delicious food, save more gas and time for you. The small amount of beneficial iron elements dissolved in wok cooking can provide the iron elements needed by human body and it is absorbed easily. Steady Handle: Mecete Traditional Hand Hammered Uncoated Carbon Steel Pow Wok has a strong and steady handle. As you can see from the photos, the handle of the wok is the same piece with the wok itself. No more worry about the loose handle problem.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61I1ApTLp1L._AC_SL1296_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mecete","source_asin":"B08JLHTVVH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194400","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08JLHTVVH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08JLHTVVH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
