window.products.push({"id":194524,"name":"Emile Henry 14-by-11-Inch Lasagna Baker, White","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c8isYZsjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Product description Exclusive Ceradon technology produces the Emile Henry Classics Lasagna/Roasting Dish that is remarkably shock-resistant and durable for years of healthy cooking. The 14\"x11\" ceramic casserole dish is covered with a hardwearing translucent glaze that withstands cracks, chips, scratches and discoloration. The perfect ceramic bakeware for serving bubbling oven-baked lasagna, the Classics ovenware also cooks up superb vegetable casseroles, macaroni and cheese, and even cinnamon buns, fudge and brownies. Designed of high-fired natural Burgandy clay, the roasting dish is unsurpassed in conducting and retaining heat and does not absorb odors or flavors. With its efficient thermal properties, the casserole dish can go directly from freezer to a hot oven without countertop warm-up. Easy-grip, wide handles ensure safe handling. A cream interior and rich exterior color make the Emile Henry bakeware a stylish serving dish for any occasion. Safe for oven, broiler and microwave up to 500 F. Dishwasher-safe.Founded in 1850 by the Henry family in France's mineral-rich Burgundy clay region, today Emile Henry is the largest manufacturer of ceramic ovenware in France. The French company has established a worldwide reputation for crafting the finest quality ceramic culinary products. Skilled artisans meticulously oversee the forming, casting, glazing and firing of each hand-finished Emile Henry piece. The proprietary Ceradon manufacturing process produces ovenware that is highly resistant to thermal shock, mechanical shock or chipping and crazing. Amazon.com Ideal for roasting meat and poultry, including a large turkey, this 11-by-14-inch dish is a traditional French shape and has a smooth exterior that makes it welcome in contemporary kitchens. It can go directly from freezer to oven, into the microwave, under the broiler, and through the dishwasher without harming its glossy, lead-free glaze, which does not absorb odors or moisture and is so hard it will not crack, discolor, or scratch--even if food is cut on it. Beautiful enough to grace a dining table, it measures 3 inches deep and weighs 5.9 pounds. Since 1850, Emile Henry cookware and bakeware have been made in Burgundy, where a unique clay is kiln-fired into a ceramic unsurpassed for conducting and retaining heat. Prized worldwide, Emile Henry products come in a wide range of colors, from the earth tones (with creamy interiors) of the rustic Le Potier line to the bright hues (with white interiors) of the Couleurs line, of which this all-white dish is a gleaming example. Each piece is stamped with the year it was made and the initials of the craftsman responsible for its perfection and carries a one-year warranty against defects. --Fred Brack","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c8isYZsjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Emile Henry","source_asin":"B0000636WX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194524","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0000636WX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0000636WX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":194525,"name":"MIRA 24 oz Stainless Steel Water Bottle with Straw Lid - Hydro Vacuum Insulated Metal Thermos Flask Keeps Cold for 24 Hours, Hot for 12 Hours - BPA-Fr","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":17.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8146MqMrmvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Innovative Vacuum Insulation: Keep drinks cold for 24 hours or hot for 12 hours with our highly rated insulated water bottle. Our thermos water bottle uses our innovative MiraGuard Technology to maintain inside temperatures for several hours. With our double-wall vacuum insulation, condensation is prevented from forming on the bottles exterior so your thermal bottle won’t sweat in your hands. Built to Last: Take your durable bottle made from 18/8 food-grade stainless steel bottle on any adventure! Whether you’re working out at the gym or catching swell waves at the beach, your sports water bottle is there for all your hydration needs. Known for its quality and purity, our stainless steel water bottles provide a clean, non-metallic taste that won’t retain or transfer flavors. Functional Style: Our sleek and rugged thermos bottle has a simple pull down lever for quick sipping. The straw lid can be used with one hand, making it great for work, school, fitness and travel. Our straw lid also features a sturdy carry handle for convenient portability. Pack your leak proof and sweat proof metal canteen in your bag, backpack or luggage without worrying about spills. Health in Mind: Sip healthy with our BPA-free water bottle made from non-toxic materials. Use your reusable water bottle to stay hydrated all day long. For the coldest drink, remove the lid and add ice cubes to your insulated flask. Perfect Size: Fill up your hydro bottle with the beverage of your choice and feel refreshed throughout the day. The compact size of your modern water bottle holds large amounts of liquids without taking up too much space. The wide mouth opening of the insulated bottle allows for fast filling, drinking and cleaning.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8146MqMrmvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MIRA","source_asin":"B07N6NRZLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194525","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07N6NRZLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07N6NRZLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
