window.products.push({"id":194703,"name":"SENSES Premium Toothbrush Holder | Automatic Toothpaste Dispenser for Kids | 3 Family dust Free Cups | 6 Toothbrush Holders | Sink Organizer | Necessi","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nj-fD6dSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"✔️ Experience premium superior quality toothpaste dispenser and Toothbrush Holder by SENSES. America's number #1 toothbrush holder and toothpaste dispenser designed for ease of use and simplification. Take the stress out of your life with a creative design to make your bathroom look clean.✔️ Multiple Storage Space for family of six people with three magnetic cups Store up to six toothbrushes including electric toothbrushes and enough space on top for all your essentials. Also includes a small drawer for smaller items such as your phone and Dental floss.✔️ Toothpaste dispenser made form food-grade silica gel which is environmentally and safe for everyday use. Easy to operate toothpaste dispenser that works with suction. With a gentle press of the dispenser you will receive a humble amount of toothpaste directly onto your toothbrush.✔️ Simple and easy to install Easy installation against any surface inducing glass, wall paper and ceramic tiles. No need to drill holes in the wall. Simple clean the surface you want to place the Holder, unwrap the sticky holder and apply to the wall. An absolute must have for every family that loves organised and clean Easy to follow instructions for SENSES Toothbrush holder and dispenser Step 1: Clean the surface that you want to apply the SENSES Toothbrush holder onto. Step 2: Place the wall mount onto the back on the holder and then tear of the film of the back on the wall mount. Step 3: Get your alignment just right and the press the SENSES Toothbrush holder firmly against the wall. Step 4: Remove the SENSES toothbrush holder from its wall mount by sliding the holder upwards the push out all the air from the wall mount. Step 5: Wait for about 3 hours for the adhesive to take full effect and then place the SENSES toothbrush holder back onto the wall mounts.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61nj-fD6dSL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SENSES","source_asin":"B082G26R3B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194703","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B082G26R3B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B082G26R3B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
