window.products.push({"id":194921,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, Stick Vacuum with 25Kpa 300W Powerful Suction, 6-in-1 Rechargeable Vacuum with 2500m-Ah Battery, Up to 45mins Runtime Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":129.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Pl8wU34L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Quick & Deep Clean--S610 cordless vacuum cleaner is the newest, most powerful, and cost-effective model among INSE cordless stick vacuum. The vacuum cleaner provides continuous 25Kpa extremely powerful suction in MAX mode, cordless vacuum instantly picks up pet hair, fine dus-t, debris, large particles from carpet, hardwood floor, tile floor, marble floor, etc. 1.5x Longer Runtime than Dyxon--Cordless vacuum not only supports the strong power but also provides a longer working time and more long-lasting life than Dyxon vacuum cleaner cordless, hence offers a whole-house clea-ning. 35-45mins in standard mode 13Kpa, 12-20mins in MAX mode 25Kpa. Super Powerful yet Ultra-Quiet--due to no friction of any carbon brush, S610’s stick vacuum cleaner upgraded high-power 300W brushless motor generates much less heat and less noise (70db), which results in more energy-saving and longer service life (10 years), compared with other regular brushed motors. Furthermore, rechargeable vacuum cordless 120,000 rpm fan speed brings super-strong fade-free suction power. Upgraded High-efficiency HEPA Filter--Vacuum cordless with 5-stage fully sealed cyclone filtration system captures 99.99% of dus-t particles as small as 0.1micro, like pollen, pet dander, hair, etc. With a high-efficiency HEPA filter and high-density mesh filter combined, the whole filtration performance is 2x that of the normal filter. Avoid the motor blocked by micro dust, it can extend the machine's useful life, expels purified air, and avoid secondary pollution. Multi-purpose & Lightweight-- Vaccumm-cordless with a light body, the brush tool or crevice tool can be combined with the retractable tube to clean dus-t on the curtains or ceiling, and can be switched into a handheld vacuum cleaner to pick up debris on the table or in the gap between the car's seats; you can also attach the cleaner head to the main motor to clean the stairs with ease. Stick vacuum cleaner with one button quickly empty the 1.2L extra-large dus-t cup, no need to touch the dirt. Compact Storage | No-worry Service--Wireless vacuum cleaner has two easy storage ways: wall-hanging mode and self-standing mode. Please Note: The HEPA filter can't be washed, you can clean it by cleaning gadget. Each product ordered from our store comes with 24x7 online customer service and a 12-month 100% satisfactory after-sales service for the pet hair vacuum. Any concerns, we are always here.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616Pl8wU34L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B0BD7X5T1K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194921","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BD7X5T1K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BD7X5T1K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
