window.products.push({"id":194962,"name":"Pink Balloons Arch Kit, Pastel White Light Pink Balloon Garland Kit for Happy Birthday Bridal Shower Wedding Party Decorations for Girls and Women, Me","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IODr4ikjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Metallic Pink Balloon Garland Arch Kit Include: 5 inch metallic pink, pink, white balloons total 40 pcs, 10 inch pink balloon 30 pcs, 12 inch metallic pink, white, sequin balloons total 30 pcs, 18 inch pink and white balloons total 4 pcs, 1 Balloon Chain, 1 roll of glue dots, 1 knot tool. The Pastel Balloon Wreath Kit is easy to assemble and the pastel colors are so pretty, perfect for bridal showers, birthday parties, baby showers, etc., and decorate your party perfectly. Tips - Order the party set in advance and when it arrives, check it for anything missing so we have time to replace it before your party. - Children must be used under adult supervision. If not, keep away from children. - Please do not overfill the gentle variety of balloons and avoid sunburn, overheating, sharp objects and excessive friction.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IODr4ikjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HDO","source_asin":"B09Y5QZWMX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194962","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Y5QZWMX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Y5QZWMX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":194963,"name":"17.7\" x 117\" Self Adhesive Velvet Drawer Liner for Jewelry Box Dresser Cabinets Shelves Art Crafts DIY Photo Project Peel and Stick Felt Fabric Drawer","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":22.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510y92F4QaS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Multi-Use Peel and Stick Velvet Liner MATERIAL: This is a premium self-adhesive material for heavy-duty use, eliminates the trouble of using glue, long lasting, smooth and soft finish  WIDE USUAGE: Ideal for art & craft making, stationery, toy, jewelry box, bags, interior design, house adorning, garments and costumes; Also can be used to wrap anything, will not cause any damage to your paint, metal or plastic finish  CONVENIENT TO USE: the felt was easy to cut, peel and stick to any clean flat surfaces ,No adhesive residue with remain on removal. Package includes:>/b> One Roll Peel and Stick Velvet Liner","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/510y92F4QaS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TAOGIFT","source_asin":"B08YYV472N","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194963","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08YYV472N","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08YYV472N","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":194964,"name":"Oxford OF218W White Analogue Clock for Outdoor Vehicles","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":52.43,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZdLDiDJwL._AC_.jpg","description":"The Oxford Clock is a high specification analogue clock designed and tested to endure vibration, heat and extreme weathers specifically for use on a motorcycle or any type of outdoor vehicle. Constructed from tough alloy and stainless steel with a hardened mineral glass facial protecting the Swiss New lite luminous clock hands for better night-time visibility, the Oxford Clock has passed a 250 hour salt spray test to achieve the ASTM B117 standard and is water resistant to 3 ATM. It also features a super durable Japanese watch movement with battery life extended up to 4 years and in the typical no nonsense style from Oxford, comes with 2 fitting options; a stainless steel bracket and adhesive vibration damping pad and everything else you'll need to fit the clock including screws, washers and Allen key. Available in 3 options, silver with white face; black with black face and titanium with white face.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41ZdLDiDJwL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Oxford","source_asin":"B00B1MHWSO","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194964","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00B1MHWSO","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00B1MHWSO","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":194965,"name":"Deny Designs Cori Dantini Community Tree Duvet Cover, Queen","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":199.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j07lSk-VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our duvet cover is made from an ultra soft, lightweight woven polyester printed cream top with a 100% polyester cream bottom and includes a hidden zipper with interior corner ties to secure your comforter. It’s comfy, fade-resistant, and machine washable. The comforter insert and pillow shams are not included. Based in Denver, Colorado, Deny Designs is a modern, think-outside-the-box home furnishings company. Deny empowers its customers to transform dull, everyday household accessories into fun and original statement. With each purchase, our team of talented artists earn part of the proceeds, enabling Deny to support art communities all over the world while also spreading the creative love!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91j07lSk-VL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Deny Designs","source_asin":"B00JDVDM02","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194965","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00JDVDM02","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00JDVDM02","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":194966,"name":"Cordless Blackout S Wave Window Blinds, Lake Blue Fabric Energy Saving Light Filtering Vertical Blinds for Windows, Doors, Room Partition","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":58.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o5kXcmYKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"① DESCRIPTION: Vertical blinds will make any window look and feel brand new. Enjoy pristine slats that turn and glide smoothly to reveal or hide your view. S-shaped corrugations create a three-dimensional effect. Room darkening slats hang straight and evenly for a neat finish. 100% polyester with blackout fabric same backside color provide you good rest and privacy protection. ② MADE-TO-ORDER: We provide custom service to make sure you can receive correct shade size. Choosing the color and type you want. Hit the “customize now” button on the right side to fill out your custom measurements. Choosing mounting type, provide custom measurements. If your size is not found on the customize list, please select the closest size to process order. If you have questions. Add any optional additional comments. Then we will contact you in 24 hours to confirm the order details. ③ INTERNAL MOUNT: For inside mount, at least 2 inches depth is needed, fill out the customization form with the exact measurement of the OPENING to the 1/16th inch then WE WILL TAKE 0.4 INCH deduction off the exact window width and 0.25 INCH deduction off the exact window height so the blind will fit perfectly in that opening. If the blind size same as the opening width, it will be hard for you to install the blind inside the opening. ④ EXTERNAL MOUNT: WE WILL NOT MAKE ANY ADJUSTMENT, so provide us with the exact shade size you want when filling out the customization form. Outside mounts are traditionally mounted above the window opening and go slightly wider than the opening. Usually shades width need to be 3\" to 10\" wider than window width, shade height need to be 5\" to 10\" longer than window height for better coverage. All mounting brackets are included, easy to install. ⑤ SHIPPING & SERVICE: Our window roller shade contains an accessory kit includingbracket,screws and install instruction for convenience.To make sure you receive the package quickly and correctly please reconfirm the shipping address. A kind reminder, BOX address is not available, so please provide your physical address. Before you place the order or after you received the package, any questions feel free to contact customer service.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71o5kXcmYKL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Facimi","source_asin":"B0BWWMWDRF","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-194966","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BWWMWDRF","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BWWMWDRF","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
